# The datasets are downloaded from LRZ Sync+Share (see README.md) and are patient-/
# phantom-derived and large -> they are NOT tracked in git.
#
# We keep tracked only:
#   - this .gitignore
#   - README.md (how to download + the data layout)
#   - ONE example sample folder (spines_phantoms/dataset_256/Phantom1) so the folder
#     is not empty and the per-sample structure is visible in the repo.

# Ignore everything at the top level of data/ ...
/*

# ... but keep these:
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Keep the single Phantom1 example (un-ignore each parent, re-ignore its siblings):
!/spines_phantoms/
/spines_phantoms/*
!/spines_phantoms/dataset_256/
/spines_phantoms/dataset_256/*
!/spines_phantoms/dataset_256/Phantom1/
